 "notes": [
  "topology: source -> pool -> {sweep declaring rows 3768..3928 attention-first from the midpoint at DEFERRED; a playhead declaring one INTERACTIVE row at a time on a gaussian random walk (sigma 8.0 rows, 12% chance of re-anchoring) every 50 ms, superseding its own previous request}. Seed 7, so the person is the same in every arm.",
